   "op": "district_note",
   "state": "West Bengal",
   "field": "disagreement",
   "text": "23 notified districts, confirmed 18 Nov 2026 against the LGD active-district feed (no creation since Paschim Bardhaman, 21 Apr 2017), the CEO West Bengal district list and the absence of any district website for an announced name. The 22 Jun 2026 budget announced Kolkata (as a full revenue district), Basirhat, Sundarbans, Jangipur and Arambagh; none is notified. Their names are parked as aliases on their parent districts, each parent verified at block level in LGD: Basirhat -> North 24 Parganas, Sundarban -> South 24 Parganas (Canning, Kakdwip), Jangipur -> Murshidabad, Arambagh -> Hooghly. 'Sundarban' is a known misfile risk: the region also covers North 24 Parganas blocks (Hingalganj, Sandeshkhali). The bare old-district names Midnapore and Bishnupur are deliberately not aliased: each is claimable by two current districts."
